  "new_commit_message": "feat(iterate-pr): Enable model invocation (#163)\n\nMake `iterate-pr` explicitly model-invocable in both Claude Code and\nCodex.\n\nClaude now records `disable-model-invocation: false`, while Codex gets\nthe matching `agents/openai.yaml` metadata with\n`policy.allow_implicit_invocation: true` and a focused default prompt.\nThe skill specification records the intended trigger behavior.\n\nThe shared skill-authoring guidance and repository checklist now\ndocument how to keep Claude and Codex invocation policy aligned,\nfollowing the established pattern in `dcramer/agents`.\n\n<!-- junior-request-attribution:start -->\nRequested by **David Cramer** via Junior.\n<!-- junior-request-attribution:end -->\n\n<!-- junior-session-footer:start -->\n<!-- junior-conversation-id:slack%3AC0B595QDZLL%3A1784935323.178399 -->\n\n--\n\n[View Junior\nSession](https://junior-prod.sentry.dev/conversations/slack%3AC0B595QDZLL%3A1784935323.178399)\n\n<!-- junior-session-footer:end -->\n\nCo-authored-by: sentry-junior[bot] <264270552+sentry-junior[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: David Cramer <david@sentry.io>",
